Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.69,0:22:20.73,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}When I get you sweet and sour
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:23.78,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}That you second send an hours
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.78,0:22:28.32,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}You can't behave like that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:33.16,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}When did the color leave your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:38.33,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}When did it change It used to be so green
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:40.75,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Now turned to blue
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:43.21,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:47.30,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Little bed of leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.93,0:22:54.14,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}You hand on why Do you leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.86,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Grains of sand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:03.61,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Fall through my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.61,0:23:06.57,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Trying to understand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.37,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}Blue like the ******clues
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.37,0:23:11.91,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}Blue like the ocean that I'm drowning in
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.45,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}Blue like gaba shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:15.00,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}Blue like a thing that the way and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.58,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}then that brought me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.58,0:23:18.17,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}Blue like a berry juice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.17,0:23:19.75,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}Blue like my very mood
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.63,0:23:24.76,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Now where did you go
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.76,0:23:27.93,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}I used to know you better
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.47,0:23:33.56,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}Where did you go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.69,0:22:20.73,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}当我尝到你的酸涩与甘甜
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.32,0:22:23.78,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}你却选择拉长每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.78,0:22:28.32,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}你怎能如此漠然
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.37,0:22:33.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}何时色彩离开了你的双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.62,0:22:38.33,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}何时瞳中的新绿开始消散
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.88,0:22:40.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}只剩下一片幽蓝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.25,0:22:43.21,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}幽深的蓝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:47.30,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}落叶织就的床沿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.93,0:22:54.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}你为何偏偏要离开我身边？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.69,0:22:59.86,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}沙粒一点一点
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.40,0:23:03.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}溜出我的指间
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.61,0:23:06.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}我努力去分辨
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.78,0:23:10.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}幽蓝 像未解的谜团
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.37,0:23:11.91,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}幽蓝 像我坠入的海渊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}幽蓝 像旧靴的鞋面
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.45,0:23:15.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}幽蓝 像命运牵起的线
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}带我来到你身边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.58,0:23:18.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}幽蓝 像浆果汁一般
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.17,0:23:19.75,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur0.4}是我心底的怅然
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.63,0:23:24.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}如今你究竟去了哪边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.76,0:23:27.93,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}明明曾与你心意相连
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.47,0:23:33.56,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\blur0.4}你究竟去了哪边
